  "data_abstract": "K0 REGENERATION PHASE IN CARBON. COMBINED RESULT FOR BOTH KL3 DECAY MODES IS A PHASE OF -40.9 +- 2.6 DEG AT AN AVERAGE K0 MOMENTUM OF 7.5 GEV/C. NOTE THE PHASE DEFINED HERE IS 90 DEG GREATER THAN THE ARGUMENT OF THE REGENERATION AMPLITUDE.\n",
